 is the logarithm of the numerator alone."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب $\\log_3(243/9)$ باستخدام قاعدة لوغاريتم القسمة.","En":"Evaluate $\\log_3(243/9)$ using the logarithm quotient rule."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لوغاريتم خارج القسمة يساوي فرق اللوغاريتمين للمدخلين الموجبين.","En":"The log of a quotient equals the difference of logs for positive arguments."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البسط والمقام موجبان والأساس 3 صالح، فنطبق قاعدة القسمة.","En":"Both arguments are positive and base 3 is valid, so use the quotient rule."},{"Ar":"$243=3^5,\\quad9=3^2$","En":"$243=3^5,\\quad9=3^2$"},{"Ar":"$\\log_3(243/9)=5-2=3$","En":"$\\log_3(243/9)=5-2=3$"}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسم قيم اللوغاريتمات.","En":"Do not divide the logarithm values."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b(u/v)=\\log_bu-\\log_bv","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\log_3 243-\\log_3 9=5-2=3$","En":"$\\log_3 243-\\log_3 9=5-2=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^3=243/9$","En":"$3^3=243/9$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":86,"PrimarySkillId":315,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد أس كل عدد بالنسبة للأساس 3.","En":"Find each argument's exponent in base 3."},{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة القسمة واطرح قيمة لوغاريتم المقام من البسط.","En":"Use the quotient rule and subtract the denominator logarithm from the numerator logarithm."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لوغاريتم خارج القسمة يساوي فرق اللوغاريتمين للمدخلين الموجبين.","En":"The log of a quotient equals the difference of logs for positive arguments."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"البسط والمقام موجبان والأساس 3 صالح، فنطبق قاعدة القسمة.","En":"Both arguments are positive and base 3 is valid, so use the quotient rule."},{"Ar":"$243=3^5,\\quad9=3^2$","En":"$243=3^5,\\quad9=3^2$"},{"Ar":"$\\log_3(243/9)=5-2=3$","En":"$\\log_3(243/9)=5-2=3$"}],"Result":